(1411260, 181076, 33672, '<td valign="top">This must of been a tough subject to photograph   I would''ve liked a little more light to show off the brass on this rare and incredible time piece (but with that comes the overexposure).. I enjoy the comp and perspective but the crop''s a little tight.</td>', 'This must of been a tough subject to photograph   I would''ve liked a little more light to show off the brass on this rare and incredible time piece (but with that comes the overexposure).. I enjoy the comp and perspective but the crop''s a little tight.', '2005-05-25 11:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411264, 181812, 33672, '<td valign="top">I didn;t feel that the focal point was sharp enough to pull of the very shallow DOF.  I love the comp and idea.</td>', 'I didn;t feel that the focal point was sharp enough to pull of the very shallow DOF.  I love the comp and idea.', '2005-05-25 11:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411271, 181496, 36141, '<td valign="top">this one''s nice, love the green color</td>', 'this one''s nice, love the green color', '2005-05-25 11:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411272, 180011, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very original and artistic.  I hope it does as well as it deserves.</td>', 'Very original and artistic.  I hope it does as well as it deserves.', '2005-05-25 11:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411280, 181495, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice rotated photo, but I think you should''ve left the sea out, because the horizon looks quite tilted now.</td>', 'Nice rotated photo, but I think you should''ve left the sea out, because the horizon looks quite tilted now.', '2005-05-25 11:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411282, 181586, 36141, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and composition.</td>', 'Love the colors and composition.', '2005-05-25 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411283, 181582, 33672, '<td valign="top">The use of negative space here is incredible.  I think if you''d used a little more light to enable you to use a faster shutter speed, the fallling and bouncing grains would''ve been more pronounced. I still think its one of the most creative here.</td>', 'The use of negative space here is incredible.  I think if you''d used a little more light to enable you to use a faster shutter speed, the fallling and bouncing grains would''ve been more pronounced. I still think its one of the most creative here.', '2005-05-25 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
