(1411367, 181813, 35602, '<td valign="top">I liked this one a lot.  It is simple, yet the grain detail is very nice.  I think it could have been more saturated, though.</td>', 'I liked this one a lot.  It is simple, yet the grain detail is very nice.  I think it could have been more saturated, though.', '2005-05-25 11:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
