(1411377, 181068, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred a close up of the flowers, since at this size, it''s hard to tell it''s sand. Some more detail would have been nice. 7.</td>', 'I''d have preferred a close up of the flowers, since at this size, it''s hard to tell it''s sand. Some more detail would have been nice. 7.', '2005-05-25 11:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
