(1411380, 181343, 27845, '<td valign="top">...and Ash to Ashes. Good colouring, it gives the right mood. I''d have liked the arms to fade into darkness. 8.</td>', '...and Ash to Ashes. Good colouring, it gives the right mood. I''d have liked the arms to fade into darkness. 8.', '2005-05-25 12:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
