(1411385, 180307, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but you should have submitted a larger one, so as to show the good detail on this. It looks a bit oversharpened. 8.</td>', 'Nice image, but you should have submitted a larger one, so as to show the good detail on this. It looks a bit oversharpened. 8.', '2005-05-25 12:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
