(1411398, 181136, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was one of those once in a lifetime shots.  I love the pink edging light on the moth.  I don''t know how you got this one.  I''d really like to know.</td>', 'This was one of those once in a lifetime shots.  I love the pink edging light on the moth.  I don''t know how you got this one.  I''d really like to know.', '2005-05-25 12:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
