(1411474, 181564, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture. I really like the reflections along the top, but the reflection of the photographer in the middle fo the bottom of the glass is a bit distracting. I''m not sure how this could be corrected in future - to be honest, I''m new to the finer points of lighting - but maybe covering your background with a black sheet or something would have taken away the glare and the glass wouldn''t have picked up your reflection.</td>', 'This is a great picture. I really like the reflections along the top, but the reflection of the photographer in the middle fo the bottom of the glass is a bit distracting. I''m not sure how this could be corrected in future - to be honest, I''m new to the finer points of lighting - but maybe covering your background with a black sheet or something would have taken away the glare and the glass wouldn''t have picked up your reflection.', '2005-05-25 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
