(1411824, 180590, 3741, '<td valign="top">Nice macro! A very nifty looking little critter, too. The lighting''s not quite right to capture the small details, but it is a visually interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice macro! A very nifty looking little critter, too. The lighting''s not quite right to capture the small details, but it is a visually interesting shot.', '2005-05-25 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
