(1411830, 181796, 3741, '<td valign="top">I have to say good try! I like that it''s in greyscale, and the bottle being full of sand and shells is neat, but the bottle resting atop a big scallop shell is a little much. Also I think the shot would have had more impact if the bottle was pretty beat up, though not everyone wants to mangle their bathroom decor :P</td>', 'I have to say good try! I like that it''s in greyscale, and the bottle being full of sand and shells is neat, but the bottle resting atop a big scallop shell is a little much. Also I think the shot would have had more impact if the bottle was pretty beat up, though not everyone wants to mangle their bathroom decor :P', '2005-05-25 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411835, 181519, 21915, '<td valign="top">Great colours and composition</td>', 'Great colours and composition', '2005-05-25 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411837, 180508, 3741, '<td valign="top">I like it! Very neat shot, but I''m sad that your camera was unable to produce a crisp image at that magnification.</td>', 'I like it! Very neat shot, but I''m sad that your camera was unable to produce a crisp image at that magnification.', '2005-05-25 14:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411838, 180179, 21915, '<td valign="top">great capture</td>', 'great capture', '2005-05-25 14:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
