(1411854, 181721, 3741, '<td valign="top">Neat shot! I like how you''ve left more white on the right to compliment the spill''s concentration on that side. There''s a smudge in the lower left that doesn''t belong, and it might have more impact having a portrait layout with similar left and right margins to what you have.</td>', 'Neat shot! I like how you''ve left more white on the right to compliment the spill''s concentration on that side. There''s a smudge in the lower left that doesn''t belong, and it might have more impact having a portrait layout with similar left and right margins to what you have.', '2005-05-25 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411855, 181501, 21915, '<td valign="top">Sorry I can''t see any grains</td>', 'Sorry I can''t see any grains', '2005-05-25 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411856, 181626, 31443, '<td valign="top">The idea is rather good and the prism light I like as well but what about the focus? Coffee granule doesn''t look like coffee because of the halo...</td>', 'The idea is rather good and the prism light I like as well but what about the focus? Coffee granule doesn''t look like coffee because of the halo...', '2005-05-25 15:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411857, 180990, 21915, '<td valign="top">The compostion works realy well here good work</td>', 'The compostion works realy well here good work', '2005-05-25 15:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411860, 180306, 3741, '<td valign="top">DUDE! Like, wickid! LOL, I''ve seen very few of these shots with matter flung about by a speaker, but this is marvellous! The decreasing concentration of the grains from the central point is perfect, and the naked speaker really gives this image character.</td>', 'DUDE! Like, wickid! LOL, I''ve seen very few of these shots with matter flung about by a speaker, but this is marvellous! The decreasing concentration of the grains from the central point is perfect, and the naked speaker really gives this image character.', '2005-05-25 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411861, 181431, 14773, '<td valign="top">If the focus were on the blow this would work better for me.  Right now having focus on the bill doesn''t create a lot of interest for me.  You''ve got a lot of good texture in the powder - would be cool to see it.</td>', 'If the focus were on the blow this would work better for me.  Right now having focus on the bill doesn''t create a lot of interest for me.  You''ve got a lot of good texture in the powder - would be cool to see it.', '2005-05-25 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411863, 181428, 35382, '<td valign="top">interesting.  good photo</td>', 'interesting.  good photo', '2005-05-25 15:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411864, 181175, 21915, '<td valign="top">This is just brilliant I would like I see this win</td>', 'This is just brilliant I would like I see this win', '2005-05-25 15:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1411866, 180673, 35382, '<td valign="top">great photo.</td>', 'great photo.', '2005-05-25 15:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
