(1412371, 179754, 38078, '<td valign="top">granular?  Gritty?  The photo makes me grit my teeth, but that''s because I''m an ex-smoker.</td>', 'granular?  Gritty?  The photo makes me grit my teeth, but that''s because I''m an ex-smoker.', '2005-05-25 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
