(1412376, 181405, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea for this challenge.  Lighting though is a little bit harsh and the cropping is a little bit off especially the bottle down was cut off while there''s ample space on the right of the standing bottle.  I think a centered composition may have worked here.  But I tell you, your did well in constructing this idea.</td>', 'This is a great idea for this challenge.  Lighting though is a little bit harsh and the cropping is a little bit off especially the bottle down was cut off while there''s ample space on the right of the standing bottle.  I think a centered composition may have worked here.  But I tell you, your did well in constructing this idea.', '2005-05-25 18:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1412377, 181693, 12962, '<td valign="top">Place the golf ball a little bit lower for visual anchor and you have a winner.</td>', 'Place the golf ball a little bit lower for visual anchor and you have a winner.', '2005-05-25 18:44:54.000000', NULL, 1);
