(1414170, 181328, 35804, '<td valign="top">I believe this might be more interesting with some different lighting...did you use just a flash?The light is very harsh and a bit flat. Some spot light from the side somewhere might have given this more depth...more drama...also some side/angled lighting might have brought out some of the  organza''s sheerness and created some very interesting shadow play...there are so many possibilities and expensive lights simply aren''t necessary! You should see some of my "lights"...el cheapo thingys you can get at the hardware store...have fun with it and give it a try! Improvising can be a whole lotta fun.</td>', 'I believe this might be more interesting with some different lighting...did you use just a flash?The light is very harsh and a bit flat. Some spot light from the side somewhere might have given this more depth...more drama...also some side/angled lighting might have brought out some of the  organza''s sheerness and created some very interesting shadow play...there are so many possibilities and expensive lights simply aren''t necessary! You should see some of my "lights"...el cheapo thingys you can get at the hardware store...have fun with it and give it a try! Improvising can be a whole lotta fun.', '2005-05-26 16:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
