(1414717, 181077, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice styling, is it a hair overlit?  So we could see the grains of the salt/sugar?  Maybe that''s not possible.</td>', 'Nice styling, is it a hair overlit?  So we could see the grains of the salt/sugar?  Maybe that''s not possible.', '2005-05-26 20:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
