(1414725, 181807, 3214, '<td valign="top">LOL, nice bit of humor.  Reminds me of a military curse.  Extra special touch, your scoring the paper at the appropriate length.</td>', 'LOL, nice bit of humor.  Reminds me of a military curse.  Extra special touch, your scoring the paper at the appropriate length.', '2005-05-26 20:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
