(1414786, 181324, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very very well done picture. The tip of the pencil and the grains flying out in a circular pattern have made a very visually arresting picture. I really like the fact that you chose not to do a standard rule of thirds placement with this one. Good job !</td>', 'Very very well done picture. The tip of the pencil and the grains flying out in a circular pattern have made a very visually arresting picture. I really like the fact that you chose not to do a standard rule of thirds placement with this one. Good job !', '2005-05-26 21:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1414789, 181077, 5286, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Technically very sound too. I just wonder if it would be more effective rotated 90 degrees?</td>', 'Great idea! Technically very sound too. I just wonder if it would be more effective rotated 90 degrees?', '2005-05-26 21:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
