(1417289, 180673, 3741, '<td valign="top">LOL, nice title. It''s a nice shot too! Lotsa interesting details, and I like the juxtaposition of the rocks with the the smooth exoskeleton of the beetle. No minus points save the piece of vegetation on the extreme left edge.</td>', 'LOL, nice title. It''s a nice shot too! Lotsa interesting details, and I like the juxtaposition of the rocks with the the smooth exoskeleton of the beetle. No minus points save the piece of vegetation on the extreme left edge.', '2005-05-28 07:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
