(1417773, 181604, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture. So smooth, sharp, detailed. Great pattern, and I like the lack of excess distracting elements in the frame. Only thing is, I don''t get the sense of ''granular'' from this.</td>', 'Awesome picture. So smooth, sharp, detailed. Great pattern, and I like the lack of excess distracting elements in the frame. Only thing is, I don''t get the sense of ''granular'' from this.', '2005-05-28 16:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
