(1417788, 181430, 34247, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit on the small side. The selective desat isn''t very effective, imho. The grains aren''t emphasized enough by the focus choice, and I feel this image could improve with closer crop, sharper focus on the graininess.</td>', 'Image is a bit on the small side. The selective desat isn''t very effective, imho. The grains aren''t emphasized enough by the focus choice, and I feel this image could improve with closer crop, sharper focus on the graininess.', '2005-05-28 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1417800, 181428, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great image. The lighting is really nice. I like the snail''s shadow, and the translucency of the snail and shell, you can see it backlit. Great idea too, very creative and original.</td>', 'Great image. The lighting is really nice. I like the snail''s shadow, and the translucency of the snail and shell, you can see it backlit. Great idea too, very creative and original.', '2005-05-28 17:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
