(1417806, 180118, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  Looks like a photo from a cooking magazine.  I like the mix of the different grains and colors.</td>', 'I like this very much.  Looks like a photo from a cooking magazine.  I like the mix of the different grains and colors.', '2005-05-28 17:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
