(1417810, 181623, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting. Is this taken on a beach or in a studio? I can''t tell, but this image really stands out in the challenge as one of the best.</td>', 'Fabulous lighting. Is this taken on a beach or in a studio? I can''t tell, but this image really stands out in the challenge as one of the best.', '2005-05-28 17:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
