(1418021, 181175, 29440, '<td valign="top">This an outstanding pic. It has action, sharpness, vibrant colors, and I like the look on the girls face that shows she is paying attention to the task at hand.  IMHO, this will take the blue ribbon.</td>', 'This an outstanding pic. It has action, sharpness, vibrant colors, and I like the look on the girls face that shows she is paying attention to the task at hand.  IMHO, this will take the blue ribbon.', '2005-05-28 20:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
