(1419086, 181715, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is really cute.  Definite points for set up and I really like the lighting.  I do wish it was bigger though.</td>', 'This is really cute.  Definite points for set up and I really like the lighting.  I do wish it was bigger though.', '2005-05-29 16:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
