(1419090, 180489, 38476, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative! You''ve added real interest to this subject! (Is your title taken from Dicken''s "Great Expectations"?)</td>', 'Very imaginative! You''ve added real interest to this subject! (Is your title taken from Dicken''s "Great Expectations"?)', '2005-05-29 16:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
