(1419142, 180292, 38476, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this subject. &amp; well done for capturing the "grains" of water in the center of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting take on this subject. & well done for capturing the "grains" of water in the center of the photo.', '2005-05-29 17:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419153, 181224, 26756, '<td valign="top">The composition of this one is a bit distracting...the setup of the shot.  The focus seems meant to be on the flowers and sand, yet there is so much around it that is not well lit and unclear which distracts from it.  I think a different angle or approach would have made this shot better.</td>', 'The composition of this one is a bit distracting...the setup of the shot.  The focus seems meant to be on the flowers and sand, yet there is so much around it that is not well lit and unclear which distracts from it.  I think a different angle or approach would have made this shot better.', '2005-05-29 17:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419158, 181339, 26756, '<td valign="top">For this particular pic I''m not too crazy for the b&amp;w.  The only other thing I see is it seems a bit underexposed, like the sugar should be more white.</td>', 'For this particular pic I''m not too crazy for the b&w.  The only other thing I see is it seems a bit underexposed, like the sugar should be more white.', '2005-05-29 17:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419178, 181683, 33352, '<td valign="top">Big Grains, Very nice image....8</td>', 'Big Grains, Very nice image....8', '2005-05-29 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419179, 181175, 38476, '<td valign="top">Good decision to use a fast shutter speed, &amp; the bright colors of the woman''s clothing adds nicely to the photo.</td>', 'Good decision to use a fast shutter speed, & the bright colors of the woman''s clothing adds nicely to the photo.', '2005-05-29 17:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419189, 181715, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great submission for the challenge &amp; I like your placing of the shadow.</td>', 'Great submission for the challenge & I like your placing of the shadow.', '2005-05-29 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419191, 181769, 38476, '<td valign="top">Man! What a photo! The hairs in the nose are just too much!!! (But it''s granular...)</td>', 'Man! What a photo! The hairs in the nose are just too much!!! (But it''s granular...)', '2005-05-29 18:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419201, 179738, 38476, '<td valign="top">Granular clouds?</td>', 'Granular clouds?', '2005-05-29 18:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419203, 181228, 8981, '<td valign="top">I like this one!  Very creative idea and very nice lighting.</td>', 'I like this one!  Very creative idea and very nice lighting.', '2005-05-29 18:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419206, 181729, 38476, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. Looks like rocks at a quarry.</td>', 'Nice effect. Looks like rocks at a quarry.', '2005-05-29 18:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419246, 180306, 34836, '<td valign="top">I like it.  It''s too bad you couldn''t hide the wires on the back side of the speaker.</td>', 'I like it.  It''s too bad you couldn''t hide the wires on the back side of the speaker.', '2005-05-29 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419251, 180773, 34836, '<td valign="top">The shape of the sand is really distracting.  Good composition though.  I like the way you balanced it with the candles.</td>', 'The shape of the sand is really distracting.  Good composition though.  I like the way you balanced it with the candles.', '2005-05-29 18:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419253, 181328, 34836, '<td valign="top">This had great potential.  If you could have brought out the colors just a little bit more, I think it would have helped.  I like the composition though.  Great shapes.</td>', 'This had great potential.  If you could have brought out the colors just a little bit more, I think it would have helped.  I like the composition though.  Great shapes.', '2005-05-29 19:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419259, 180033, 34836, '<td valign="top">You have a slight mound just left of the rings.  It''s quite noticable.  But I still like it.  I like the single color against the white.  And you did a pretty good job with the rings.</td>', 'You have a slight mound just left of the rings.  It''s quite noticable.  But I still like it.  I like the single color against the white.  And you did a pretty good job with the rings.', '2005-05-29 19:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419260, 181833, 34836, '<td valign="top">Tough one to pull off.  It comes across as dark.  I like the creativity.</td>', 'Tough one to pull off.  It comes across as dark.  I like the creativity.', '2005-05-29 19:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419265, 180807, 34836, '<td valign="top">The random colors are just too scattered.  Although the rock sticks out as the subject, there''s nothing that ties the photo together.</td>', 'The random colors are just too scattered.  Although the rock sticks out as the subject, there''s nothing that ties the photo together.', '2005-05-29 19:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419269, 179865, 34836, '<td valign="top">The addition of the other spoons really helped this photo.  They draw the viewer to the mound.  Sure beats a single spoonful of something.</td>', 'The addition of the other spoons really helped this photo.  They draw the viewer to the mound.  Sure beats a single spoonful of something.', '2005-05-29 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419273, 181384, 34836, '<td valign="top">It''s obvious you rotated the photo, but in doing so, you really made it look un-natural.</td>', 'It''s obvious you rotated the photo, but in doing so, you really made it look un-natural.', '2005-05-29 19:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419277, 181577, 34836, '<td valign="top">The whites are too bright for this composition.  A background closer to the color of the inside of the crucible would have been better.</td>', 'The whites are too bright for this composition.  A background closer to the color of the inside of the crucible would have been better.', '2005-05-29 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419284, 181599, 34836, '<td valign="top">Should have chosen something different than a piece of wood for the background.</td>', 'Should have chosen something different than a piece of wood for the background.', '2005-05-29 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419288, 181811, 34836, '<td valign="top">Should have made the front treads in focus.  It would have had a better affect.</td>', 'Should have made the front treads in focus.  It would have had a better affect.', '2005-05-29 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1419289, 181721, 38240, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2005-05-29 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
