(1421480, 181599, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of different tpes of granularity.  I don''t know if I like having wood as the background (although it too has a granular sort of texture).</td>', 'Nice capture of different tpes of granularity.  I don''t know if I like having wood as the background (although it too has a granular sort of texture).', '2005-05-30 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
