(1421603, 181540, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here a lot - showing the different textures in the containers. but I think the execution could be improved. the simple plastic bowls aren''t very attractive, the background is bland and the crop is poor. If you had, for example, lined up the bowls carefully and cropped so that each had exactly 1/4 of the bowl in each corner, it would have provided more visual punch.</td>', 'I like the idea here a lot - showing the different textures in the containers. but I think the execution could be improved. the simple plastic bowls aren''t very attractive, the background is bland and the crop is poor. If you had, for example, lined up the bowls carefully and cropped so that each had exactly 1/4 of the bowl in each corner, it would have provided more visual punch.', '2005-05-30 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1421606, 181437, 8624, '<td valign="top">great color and texture in a nice macro shot.</td>', 'great color and texture in a nice macro shot.', '2005-05-30 19:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
