(1422577, 181519, 36931, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours &amp; composition!</td>', 'Lovely colours & composition!', '2005-05-31 08:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422582, 181224, 36931, '<td valign="top">I love the subject and lighting - IMHO I just feel that the composition could be better! Nevertheless, a lovely image :)</td>', 'I love the subject and lighting - IMHO I just feel that the composition could be better! Nevertheless, a lovely image :)', '2005-05-31 08:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422587, 181821, 36931, '<td valign="top">Excellent !! (though I (personally) would prefer a bit more light reflected by the left side of the cup) :)</td>', 'Excellent !! (though I (personally) would prefer a bit more light reflected by the left side of the cup) :)', '2005-05-31 09:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422613, 181604, 19010, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this trick before. This is the second time around for me on this one and I still wan''t more. This makes for a fantastic shot. It will be a good long while before I get bored with these. Very nice abstract feel, wonderfull colors and lighting. The POV that you chose works perfectly. Very nice shot 9</td>', 'I''ve seen this trick before. This is the second time around for me on this one and I still wan''t more. This makes for a fantastic shot. It will be a good long while before I get bored with these. Very nice abstract feel, wonderfull colors and lighting. The POV that you chose works perfectly. Very nice shot 9', '2005-05-31 09:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422617, 181175, 19010, '<td valign="top">This image just feels like Librado to me. Not that thats a bad thing. Great lighting, wonderfull skin tones and an interesting model. Very realistic and cultural photo. The capture on the wheat is dead on. Very very nicely done.</td>', 'This image just feels like Librado to me. Not that thats a bad thing. Great lighting, wonderfull skin tones and an interesting model. Very realistic and cultural photo. The capture on the wheat is dead on. Very very nicely done.', '2005-05-31 09:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422621, 181323, 36931, '<td valign="top">Shadow is often good, but I feel that the light areas here aren''t *quite* light enough,</td>', 'Shadow is often good, but I feel that the light areas here aren''t *quite* light enough,', '2005-05-31 09:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422625, 181121, 25095, '<td valign="top">The reflection could have probably been cut down with a circular polarizer, I do like the angle of this.  The lighting may be just a little too bright becuase it hurts the texture of the subject.  Great different idea.</td>', 'The reflection could have probably been cut down with a circular polarizer, I do like the angle of this.  The lighting may be just a little too bright becuase it hurts the texture of the subject.  Great different idea.', '2005-05-31 09:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422628, 180929, 25095, '<td valign="top">they almost look like fresh water pearls.  Great job.  Love the wild rice (?) thrown in for contrast.  Good job</td>', 'they almost look like fresh water pearls.  Great job.  Love the wild rice (?) thrown in for contrast.  Good job', '2005-05-31 09:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422631, 181385, 25095, '<td valign="top">nice suttle lighing, love the sugar coming out of the bag.  Well done.</td>', 'nice suttle lighing, love the sugar coming out of the bag.  Well done.', '2005-05-31 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422635, 180789, 25095, '<td valign="top">seems too black for cocoa but a good idea all in all.  Good depth of field and lighting.  Good luck</td>', 'seems too black for cocoa but a good idea all in all.  Good depth of field and lighting.  Good luck', '2005-05-31 09:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422636, 181136, 36931, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - particularly the colours, but (I think, anyway :P ) the black edging and the glass in the background detract from the image somewhat.</td>', 'Lovely shot - particularly the colours, but (I think, anyway :P ) the black edging and the glass in the background detract from the image somewhat.', '2005-05-31 09:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422638, 181224, 25095, '<td valign="top">little soft on the flowers themselves and the harsh shadow on the right hurts the image but a nice original idea.  Good luck</td>', 'little soft on the flowers themselves and the harsh shadow on the right hurts the image but a nice original idea.  Good luck', '2005-05-31 09:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422641, 181214, 19010, '<td valign="top">Bright, colorfull, and action packed photo. I do wish that a few more of the upper grains of sugar had been in better focus. But thats a small complaint considering the difficulty of the shot. Interesting choise of back grounds. The blue works well with me and the clouds reay add to the abtract look. very nice job 9</td>', 'Bright, colorfull, and action packed photo. I do wish that a few more of the upper grains of sugar had been in better focus. But thats a small complaint considering the difficulty of the shot. Interesting choise of back grounds. The blue works well with me and the clouds reay add to the abtract look. very nice job 9', '2005-05-31 09:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422644, 181175, 25095, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors and lighting, perfect capture of grains. points for needing validation lol.</td>', 'wonderful colors and lighting, perfect capture of grains. points for needing validation lol.', '2005-05-31 09:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422646, 180033, 25095, '<td valign="top">very cool, wonder if you could have had some flying up somehow. Got a slight bump over on the left by the last ring but a great image with good lighting and white balance.  Good luck.</td>', 'very cool, wonder if you could have had some flying up somehow. Got a slight bump over on the left by the last ring but a great image with good lighting and white balance.  Good luck.', '2005-05-31 09:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422648, 181098, 36931, '<td valign="top">Interesting view!</td>', 'Interesting view!', '2005-05-31 09:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422651, 181129, 36931, '<td valign="top">Very nice ! Though I would have preferred the exposure on the subjects to be just *a little* lighter !</td>', 'Very nice ! Though I would have preferred the exposure on the subjects to be just *a little* lighter !', '2005-05-31 09:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422653, 181270, 36931, '<td valign="top">Lovely image !</td>', 'Lovely image !', '2005-05-31 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422660, 179937, 36931, '<td valign="top">Good job !!! :)</td>', 'Good job !!! :)', '2005-05-31 09:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422662, 181253, 36931, '<td valign="top">Brilliant ! (though it would have been nice to see them carrying grains of sugar ;) )</td>', 'Brilliant ! (though it would have been nice to see them carrying grains of sugar ;) )', '2005-05-31 09:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422667, 180033, 36931, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous ! - This really appeals to me.</td>', 'Gorgeous ! - This really appeals to me.', '2005-05-31 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422740, 180678, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like it Granular hieroglyphs. I have a feeling this is just a realy cool sandpaper and we are all being made to look like fools. This has a very unusual peice. Definatel the only one of its kind in the challengs. Very crisp granuals and a very pleasant lighting. I realy like the authintic egyptian feel that the sand gives the image. Wonderfull job. 8</td>', 'I like it Granular hieroglyphs. I have a feeling this is just a realy cool sandpaper and we are all being made to look like fools. This has a very unusual peice. Definatel the only one of its kind in the challengs. Very crisp granuals and a very pleasant lighting. I realy like the authintic egyptian feel that the sand gives the image. Wonderfull job. 8', '2005-05-31 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422745, 181428, 38570, '<td valign="top">A little sadistic, but a great picture none the less</td>', 'A little sadistic, but a great picture none the less', '2005-05-31 10:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422767, 181324, 19010, '<td valign="top">As an artist this shots enough to give me the chills. Very crip image with lots of brilliant details on the wood grain. The use of graphite is definately an original concept for this challenge and fits it very well. I feel that your choice to use B&amp;W was a good one it adds alot more impact to the image and draws the viewer to the grains. I feel thet the colors would have been to distracting. Very nice job 8</td>', 'As an artist this shots enough to give me the chills. Very crip image with lots of brilliant details on the wood grain. The use of graphite is definately an original concept for this challenge and fits it very well. I feel that your choice to use B&W was a good one it adds alot more impact to the image and draws the viewer to the grains. I feel thet the colors would have been to distracting. Very nice job 8', '2005-05-31 10:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422769, 181370, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very crips image with wonderfull details. The skin tone is just breathtaking.  The facefull of sand brings back a lot of fond memories for this land locked surfer. You did a great job of capturing not only the girle beauty but the intricate beauty of the sand as well. Very nice image. 8</td>', 'Very crips image with wonderfull details. The skin tone is just breathtaking.  The facefull of sand brings back a lot of fond memories for this land locked surfer. You did a great job of capturing not only the girle beauty but the intricate beauty of the sand as well. Very nice image. 8', '2005-05-31 11:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422772, 181228, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very nice job of capturing the texture and the motion of the sugar. The sugar wall with the fine sugar flowing throught he breach is an interesting photo. I would not have thought somthing as simple as sugar could be so enjoyable to look at. Very nice job. 7</td>', 'Very nice job of capturing the texture and the motion of the sugar. The sugar wall with the fine sugar flowing throught he breach is an interesting photo. I would not have thought somthing as simple as sugar could be so enjoyable to look at. Very nice job. 7', '2005-05-31 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1422779, 181604, 34134, '<td valign="top">This gets a WOW! Really sharp, great colors. Don''t know what it is... don''t care!</td>', 'This gets a WOW! Really sharp, great colors. Don''t know what it is... don''t care!', '2005-05-31 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422782, 181325, 34134, '<td valign="top">Way, way to out of focus. Can''t tell what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Way, way to out of focus. Can''t tell what I''m looking at.', '2005-05-31 11:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422783, 181392, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very sexy and tastefully done photo. I feel that the variets of textures is what realy adds to the photo. smooth skin, granular sand, woven fabric, super fine hair. So many textures and all of them working well together and all of them in brilliantly crisp focus. Very well done 8</td>', 'Very sexy and tastefully done photo. I feel that the variets of textures is what realy adds to the photo. smooth skin, granular sand, woven fabric, super fine hair. So many textures and all of them working well together and all of them in brilliantly crisp focus. Very well done 8', '2005-05-31 11:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422793, 180788, 35739, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little cropping at top?</td>', 'Perhaps a little cropping at top?', '2005-05-31 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422796, 181354, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sugar is even coming off the spoon.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the way the sugar is even coming off the spoon.  Well done.', '2005-05-31 11:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422814, 181175, 35739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Top 10 im sure.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Top 10 im sure.', '2005-05-31 11:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422818, 181833, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the image itself however the idea is excellent.</td>', 'Not sure about the image itself however the idea is excellent.', '2005-05-31 11:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422828, 181609, 19010, '<td valign="top">This would be my favorite of the spirals. I feel that what sets this one apart from the rest is the other spirals in the background. This gives me the feeling that the spirals go on froever and that this is but a close up of one of the many spirals. The image is grisp and has a nice texture. I do feel however thatthere is just a little too much contrast in the lighting. I would have likes for the shadows to be just a bit lighter. 8</td>', 'This would be my favorite of the spirals. I feel that what sets this one apart from the rest is the other spirals in the background. This gives me the feeling that the spirals go on froever and that this is but a close up of one of the many spirals. The image is grisp and has a nice texture. I do feel however thatthere is just a little too much contrast in the lighting. I would have likes for the shadows to be just a bit lighter. 8', '2005-05-31 11:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422833, 181549, 38570, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it fits the theme, but it is a beautiful picture</td>', 'I''m not sure it fits the theme, but it is a beautiful picture', '2005-05-31 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422836, 181323, 38570, '<td valign="top">It looks so lonely...</td>', 'It looks so lonely...', '2005-05-31 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422839, 181503, 38570, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing!</td>', 'Perfect timing!', '2005-05-31 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422847, 181544, 29557, '<td valign="top">great expression, it seems like it loses sharpness down at the bottom by the mouth, but i still think it''s going to ribbon.</td>', 'great expression, it seems like it loses sharpness down at the bottom by the mouth, but i still think it''s going to ribbon.', '2005-05-31 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422851, 181325, 29557, '<td valign="top">a shot for the brown?</td>', 'a shot for the brown?', '2005-05-31 11:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422852, 179738, 29557, '<td valign="top">where''s the granular..? is this a depressed piece or what?</td>', 'where''s the granular..? is this a depressed piece or what?', '2005-05-31 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422853, 181727, 29557, '<td valign="top">good ide ajust not executed good.. was this shot through a screen door?</td>', 'good ide ajust not executed good.. was this shot through a screen door?', '2005-05-31 11:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422857, 181714, 29557, '<td valign="top">i guess somehow this could be granular, i''ll bump it up.</td>', 'i guess somehow this could be granular, i''ll bump it up.', '2005-05-31 11:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422859, 181516, 29557, '<td valign="top">out of focus, low res camera? maybe just too much motion... kind''ve just looks like a mess, no real subject.</td>', 'out of focus, low res camera? maybe just too much motion... kind''ve just looks like a mess, no real subject.', '2005-05-31 11:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422860, 181529, 29557, '<td valign="top">way too dark.</td>', 'way too dark.', '2005-05-31 11:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422862, 180308, 29557, '<td valign="top">granular...?</td>', 'granular...?', '2005-05-31 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422867, 179972, 29557, '<td valign="top">the dof would work well for this shot if the closest objects were in focus instead of the middle ones. bumping up anyway</td>', 'the dof would work well for this shot if the closest objects were in focus instead of the middle ones. bumping up anyway', '2005-05-31 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422869, 179781, 29557, '<td valign="top">is this all intentionally yellow? is the whitebalance way off?</td>', 'is this all intentionally yellow? is the whitebalance way off?', '2005-05-31 11:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422873, 180692, 29557, '<td valign="top">not a very eye pleasing shot. too much refraction and the dof seems off w/ the closest beads out of focus.</td>', 'not a very eye pleasing shot. too much refraction and the dof seems off w/ the closest beads out of focus.', '2005-05-31 11:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422875, 179992, 29557, '<td valign="top">this is one of the better hour glass shots, it just is too out of focus, and the glass has too much reflection to it.</td>', 'this is one of the better hour glass shots, it just is too out of focus, and the glass has too much reflection to it.', '2005-05-31 11:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422876, 180168, 29557, '<td valign="top">dont know what im looking at.</td>', 'dont know what im looking at.', '2005-05-31 11:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422879, 180165, 29557, '<td valign="top">is the high iso supposed to be the ''granular'' part of the challenge? a nice shot, but the subject doesn''t seem to be at all what teh challenge is asking for.</td>', 'is the high iso supposed to be the ''granular'' part of the challenge? a nice shot, but the subject doesn''t seem to be at all what teh challenge is asking for.', '2005-05-31 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422881, 181320, 29557, '<td valign="top">real nice and close, but there is no definition in this image what so over.</td>', 'real nice and close, but there is no definition in this image what so over.', '2005-05-31 11:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422884, 180775, 29557, '<td valign="top">too dark for me.</td>', 'too dark for me.', '2005-05-31 11:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422885, 181283, 19010, '<td valign="top">Ok this one made me laugh. Thsi image has a strong Ansel feel to it IMO. You have an amazing amount of detail and a DOF that goes on forever leaving the rock in the foreground and the mountains in the distance all in perfect focus. Very good composition in a high contrast image. I do feel however that as for is fitting the challenge it is a little to far outside of the box. For granular I would expect macro photography showing of the fine details of a granular substance.  The sand and the marbles are granular but you did not realy capture the granular surface well enough to make it the center of intrest. But due to the fact that it is so well done and that is is close to the challenge topic. I wouldn''t feel right giving this less than an 8. Very nice job!!</td>', 'Ok this one made me laugh. Thsi image has a strong Ansel feel to it IMO. You have an amazing amount of detail and a DOF that goes on forever leaving the rock in the foreground and the mountains in the distance all in perfect focus. Very good composition in a high contrast image. I do feel however that as for is fitting the challenge it is a little to far outside of the box. For granular I would expect macro photography showing of the fine details of a granular substance.  The sand and the marbles are granular but you did not realy capture the granular surface well enough to make it the center of intrest. But due to the fact that it is so well done and that is is close to the challenge topic. I wouldn''t feel right giving this less than an 8. Very nice job!!', '2005-05-31 11:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422886, 179886, 29557, '<td valign="top">with all these reflections i have no idea what im looking at.</td>', 'with all these reflections i have no idea what im looking at.', '2005-05-31 11:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422887, 181501, 29557, '<td valign="top">where''s the granular part?</td>', 'where''s the granular part?', '2005-05-31 11:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422888, 181328, 29557, '<td valign="top">took a second look at this image, not really eye catching but better than what i gave it.</td>', 'took a second look at this image, not really eye catching but better than what i gave it.', '2005-05-31 11:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422889, 181608, 29557, '<td valign="top">cute capture, but just too out of focus.</td>', 'cute capture, but just too out of focus.', '2005-05-31 11:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422894, 181429, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great color and wonderfull lines. You did an amazing job capturing the pollen on this shot. At first glance I though it was a motion capture of the pollen flying off of the pistle. A little disapointed it wasn''t. Stilll a very nice image that is fun to look at.</td>', 'Great color and wonderfull lines. You did an amazing job capturing the pollen on this shot. At first glance I though it was a motion capture of the pollen flying off of the pistle. A little disapointed it wasn''t. Stilll a very nice image that is fun to look at.', '2005-05-31 11:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422895, 180208, 29557, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but doesn''t seem the subject is granular, i understand sand and all but the waves have smoothed them out. perhaps im over critical, in any case im bumping up.</td>', 'nice shot, but doesn''t seem the subject is granular, i understand sand and all but the waves have smoothed them out. perhaps im over critical, in any case im bumping up.', '2005-05-31 12:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422898, 181495, 29557, '<td valign="top">nice shot, looks like a dali painting.</td>', 'nice shot, looks like a dali painting.', '2005-05-31 12:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1422899, 181253, 29557, '<td valign="top">back to comment, wonderful capture, bumping up.</td>', 'back to comment, wonderful capture, bumping up.', '2005-05-31 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
