(1423075, 179865, 25095, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and setup.  Lighting seems right and depth of field too but the pepper seems soft on the focus and maybe even a little more greenish than the black I was expecting...could just be me.  Good luck</td>', 'I like the idea and setup.  Lighting seems right and depth of field too but the pepper seems soft on the focus and maybe even a little more greenish than the black I was expecting...could just be me.  Good luck', '2005-05-31 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423082, 181552, 25095, '<td valign="top">has a weird optical illusion to it with the spiral going off the page, kind of like, is it spiraling in or out feel to it.  The depth of field is bothering me, I wonder if it would be better with it all sharp in focus...not sure.  Got a hair or something bottom left but I''m sure everyone has mentioned that.  You got good detail and was able to get nice and close but the salt doesn''t offer much in the way of interest to me.  Good luck.</td>', 'has a weird optical illusion to it with the spiral going off the page, kind of like, is it spiraling in or out feel to it.  The depth of field is bothering me, I wonder if it would be better with it all sharp in focus...not sure.  Got a hair or something bottom left but I''m sure everyone has mentioned that.  You got good detail and was able to get nice and close but the salt doesn''t offer much in the way of interest to me.  Good luck.', '2005-05-31 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423086, 181785, 25095, '<td valign="top">Love those rows.  My mom keeps buggin me to see if I can capture that cool effect you get when you drive past them and it appears to be moving but I can''t get it by myself so that will have to wait.  good colors, would have liked the sky to be less blown out but it isn''t too terrible, wish you''d had some nice puffy clouds there to help out.  Not the normal granular submission, could help or hurt you with others.  Good luck.</td>', 'Love those rows.  My mom keeps buggin me to see if I can capture that cool effect you get when you drive past them and it appears to be moving but I can''t get it by myself so that will have to wait.  good colors, would have liked the sky to be less blown out but it isn''t too terrible, wish you''d had some nice puffy clouds there to help out.  Not the normal granular submission, could help or hurt you with others.  Good luck.', '2005-05-31 13:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423089, 181246, 25095, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I have to wonder if a different angle would have put the pollen in front of the flower giving more contrast between the b/w but still a great image.  Nice lighting, I would probably up the green saturation a little if possible.  Good luck</td>', 'very nice.  I have to wonder if a different angle would have put the pollen in front of the flower giving more contrast between the b/w but still a great image.  Nice lighting, I would probably up the green saturation a little if possible.  Good luck', '2005-05-31 13:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423105, 181807, 25095, '<td valign="top">must be military toilet paper.  Man you could refinish furnature with this stuff they give us. lol.  Cool different idea, points for laugh factor but taken off for pain factor...just kidding.</td>', 'must be military toilet paper.  Man you could refinish furnature with this stuff they give us. lol.  Cool different idea, points for laugh factor but taken off for pain factor...just kidding.', '2005-05-31 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423108, 181707, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very clean and crisp image.  I think it could have benifited from a bit of back lighting tomake the lemon pop a little more, and to bring the glass out a bit as well. This fits the challenge and the most noticable aspect of the photo is the granuals of salt. I also feel that the green liquid is a bit disturbing it looks to have a slimy texture to it. Over all this is a pretty nice shot that the do fairly well. Nice job.</td>', 'Very clean and crisp image.  I think it could have benifited from a bit of back lighting tomake the lemon pop a little more, and to bring the glass out a bit as well. This fits the challenge and the most noticable aspect of the photo is the granuals of salt. I also feel that the green liquid is a bit disturbing it looks to have a slimy texture to it. Over all this is a pretty nice shot that the do fairly well. Nice job.', '2005-05-31 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423111, 181339, 25095, '<td valign="top">would like to have the sugar more white if it is supposed to be regular white sugar.  Too gray for my likings.  I''m glad you kept from being a close up macro but the sugar lacks detail.  Good luck</td>', 'would like to have the sugar more white if it is supposed to be regular white sugar.  Too gray for my likings.  I''m glad you kept from being a close up macro but the sugar lacks detail.  Good luck', '2005-05-31 13:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423123, 181136, 19010, '<td valign="top">wow great color and interesting idea. I feel that the vibrant colors and the dark background work very well with eachother. I must admit however that while I fully recognize what I am looking at I have no idea whatsoever of its signifigance or symbology. I get a feeling that there is somthing to this shot that I am missing. Overall very nice shot that ios pleasant to look at. 7</td>', 'wow great color and interesting idea. I feel that the vibrant colors and the dark background work very well with eachother. I must admit however that while I fully recognize what I am looking at I have no idea whatsoever of its signifigance or symbology. I get a feeling that there is somthing to this shot that I am missing. Overall very nice shot that ios pleasant to look at. 7', '2005-05-31 13:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423124, 181813, 25095, '<td valign="top">dirty white background and focus seems soft.  Maybe some unmasked sharpness would help.  Good luck.</td>', 'dirty white background and focus seems soft.  Maybe some unmasked sharpness would help.  Good luck.', '2005-05-31 13:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423131, 181076, 19010, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull textures and shadows on the metal surfaces. I live the crisp details that you managed to capture. I do however feel that the image is just a little bit too dark. But it could just be my crappy work monitor. This fits the challenge well and is a pleasant image to look at. Very well done 7</td>', 'Wonderfull textures and shadows on the metal surfaces. I live the crisp details that you managed to capture. I do however feel that the image is just a little bit too dark. But it could just be my crappy work monitor. This fits the challenge well and is a pleasant image to look at. Very well done 7', '2005-05-31 13:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423133, 181544, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! I like the composition and texture. My main criticism would be of the white background  - we all know that in real life teeth and eye whites aren''t brilliant white - in this image they look *too* far off white because of their proximity to that brilliant white background.</td>', 'Nicely done! I like the composition and texture. My main criticism would be of the white background  - we all know that in real life teeth and eye whites aren''t brilliant white - in this image they look *too* far off white because of their proximity to that brilliant white background.', '2005-05-31 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423135, 180109, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF and very clever use of nothing more than the light and shadow of the rise and hollow within the salt to produce a composition and sweeping curved movement to the image.</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF and very clever use of nothing more than the light and shadow of the rise and hollow within the salt to produce a composition and sweeping curved movement to the image.', '2005-05-31 13:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1423138, 180723, 19010, '<td valign="top">Bumbing this one up just because I like the colors and textures on this one. I have always found the nautalus shape to be very pleasing and I feel that you have managed to realy enhance this with  the composition you used. Very nice!!</td>', 'Bumbing this one up just because I like the colors and textures on this one. I have always found the nautalus shape to be very pleasing and I feel that you have managed to realy enhance this with  the composition you used. Very nice!!', '2005-05-31 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
