(1423287, 181515, 37103, '<td valign="top">For me there is not a strong focal point in this photo.  Maybe that could be helped if it was in better focus.</td>', 'For me there is not a strong focal point in this photo.  Maybe that could be helped if it was in better focus.', '2005-05-31 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
