(1424327, 180738, 36914, '<td valign="top">The people in the background distract from the photo. I would have waited until they were out of the picture. Good looking Sand Castle.</td>', 'The people in the background distract from the photo. I would have waited until they were out of the picture. Good looking Sand Castle.', '2005-05-31 22:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
