(1424343, 180700, 22734, '<td valign="top">Notwithatanding the little noise this is a lovely image with quite a wide view and presenting granules in many different varieties. Bump.</td>', 'Notwithatanding the little noise this is a lovely image with quite a wide view and presenting granules in many different varieties. Bump.', '2005-05-31 22:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
