(1424959, 181428, 37747, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 4score:</b></div><hr/><i> Let me guess how many comments you''ll get about how cruel this is.  Give me a break, it''s a great shot and a SNAIL.  Personally, I don''t care at all if the thing lived or died in the process of making this shot.  I regularly purchase Snail Killer Pellets, so I''m not bothered in the least.  Right now, these beasts are over-running everything in the area due to all the rain this Spring.  Kill em all ! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is amazing to me that here we have at least two photographers who are less interested in reporting suffering than they are in perpetuating suffering. I wouldn''t have guessed.</td>', 'Originally posted by 4score: Let me guess how many comments you''ll get about how cruel this is.  Give me a break, it''s a great shot and a SNAIL.  Personally, I don''t care at all if the thing lived or died in the process of making this shot.  I regularly purchase Snail Killer Pellets, so I''m not bothered in the least.  Right now, these beasts are over-running everything in the area due to all the rain this Spring.  Kill em all !   It is amazing to me that here we have at least two photographers who are less interested in reporting suffering than they are in perpetuating suffering. I wouldn''t have guessed.', '2005-06-01 01:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1424960, 181175, 11940, '<td valign="top">Well deserved winning - I also gave it the highest score :).</td>', 'Well deserved winning - I also gave it the highest score :).', '2005-06-01 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 0),
