(1424972, 181175, 31443, '<td valign="top">I have been holding my breath all week, and turned "Blue" :) I''m so thrilled with the response and to win a ribbon, it''s great! Thank you all for some wonderful comments. My daughter was my model and she was getting tired after the 3rd session and absolutely refused to do the 4th after I realized that my best shot cut the top of her head off. Even the grains were thrown all over the place, we managed to save some and cook a delicious meal with well cleaned wheat.</td>', 'I have been holding my breath all week, and turned "Blue" :) I''m so thrilled with the response and to win a ribbon, it''s great! Thank you all for some wonderful comments. My daughter was my model and she was getting tired after the 3rd session and absolutely refused to do the 4th after I realized that my best shot cut the top of her head off. Even the grains were thrown all over the place, we managed to save some and cook a delicious meal with well cleaned wheat.', '2005-06-01 01:51:27.000000', NULL, 0),
