(1425117, 181503, 25022, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted and especially you who commented.  It wasn''t too easy capturing the shot and I took various outtakes.  I even tried changing the background to black but somehow i preferred the white on white look.  Initially it was going to be a shot with sugar pouring either in or out of the spoon but found the overall composition boring and in a fit I flung the sugar in a nearby field at which point I got the idea to photograph the action. Once again thanks to all those who voted.</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted and especially you who commented.  It wasn''t too easy capturing the shot and I took various outtakes.  I even tried changing the background to black but somehow i preferred the white on white look.  Initially it was going to be a shot with sugar pouring either in or out of the spoon but found the overall composition boring and in a fit I flung the sugar in a nearby field at which point I got the idea to photograph the action. Once again thanks to all those who voted.', '2005-06-01 03:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
