(1425257, 181475, 24330, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all you voters, this is my best result so far.<br/>For those interested the place is Ocean beach, 20 mins south of Hastings,NZ North Island.<br/>Its usually deserted except for a few surfers, this in spite of the 160,000 people living within 30 mins by car.</td>', 'Thanks to all you voters, this is my best result so far.For those interested the place is Ocean beach, 20 mins south of Hastings,NZ North Island.Its usually deserted except for a few surfers, this in spite of the 160,000 people living within 30 mins by car.', '2005-06-01 04:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1425297, 181718, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gloda:</b></div><hr/><i> You now, if I hadn''t given you that 8, we''d have swapped places :) Then you''d have had a ribbon/mention of every kind ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You ONLY gave me an 8?? What''s wrong with you??<br/>I''m gonna'' go start a new thread and complain about it!!!<br/> <br/>ROFL (j/k) - Thanks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-01 04:51:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by gloda: You now, if I hadn''t given you that 8, we''d have swapped places :) Then you''d have had a ribbon/mention of every kind ;)  You ONLY gave me an 8?? What''s wrong with you??I''m gonna'' go start a new thread and complain about it!!! ROFL (j/k) - Thanks!', '2005-06-01 04:56:58.000000', '2005-06-01 05:51:08.000000', 0),
