(1425477, 181228, 34459, '<td valign="top">Wow ! What a surprise ! I''ve been watching the scores on this one very carefully &amp; hoped I might squeeze into top 10 - I couldn''t believe it when I looked this morning &amp; there I was on the front page.<br/> <br/>Thanks so much for all your votes and comments - its amazing how a last minute idea turned into my first ribbon. <br/> <br/>Oh, and I''ve cleaned my sensor now ;-)</td>', 'Wow ! What a surprise ! I''ve been watching the scores on this one very carefully & hoped I might squeeze into top 10 - I couldn''t believe it when I looked this morning & there I was on the front page. Thanks so much for all your votes and comments - its amazing how a last minute idea turned into my first ribbon.  Oh, and I''ve cleaned my sensor now ;-)', '2005-06-01 08:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
