(1425822, 181807, 30817, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what everyone''s laughing about. I did this for years to toughen my kids up. Congratulations on seeing your spark of inspiration generate so much response, which is one of the more fun rewards of good photography.</td>', 'Don''t know what everyone''s laughing about. I did this for years to toughen my kids up. Congratulations on seeing your spark of inspiration generate so much response, which is one of the more fun rewards of good photography.', '2005-06-01 10:55:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1425867, 181204, 30817, '<td valign="top">I recognize this as a passion fruit blossom. One of the most exotic blooms in nature. I hope you also shoot these in order to get the whole flower.</td>', 'I recognize this as a passion fruit blossom. One of the most exotic blooms in nature. I hope you also shoot these in order to get the whole flower.', '2005-06-01 11:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1425909, 181812, 30817, '<td valign="top">I am confident that someone of your artistic aptitude will not find discouragement in your placement for this challenge. As I was going through the results I thought, "How would Henri Cartier-Bresson have fared in the challenges at DPC?"  Not too well, I am afraid. I have said I would rather one person NEEDED to see my photograph than one thousand who liked seeing my photograph. If no one else, I needed to see this photograph. Thank you.</td>', 'I am confident that someone of your artistic aptitude will not find discouragement in your placement for this challenge. As I was going through the results I thought, "How would Henri Cartier-Bresson have fared in the challenges at DPC?"  Not too well, I am afraid. I have said I would rather one person NEEDED to see my photograph than one thousand who liked seeing my photograph. If no one else, I needed to see this photograph. Thank you.', '2005-06-01 11:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1425968, 181325, 30817, '<td valign="top">After reading your Photographer''s Comments, my thought is; you did all that to get this?? You would be wise to spend some time in your software tutorials or get some besic editing books to study. Not trying to be sarcastic or derogatory, but this shot could only have looked better right out of the camera.</td>', 'After reading your Photographer''s Comments, my thought is; you did all that to get this?? You would be wise to spend some time in your software tutorials or get some besic editing books to study. Not trying to be sarcastic or derogatory, but this shot could only have looked better right out of the camera.', '2005-06-01 11:40:35.000000', NULL, 0),
