(1426400, 181523, 34247, '<td valign="top">I was one of your three 10s here. I thought this image had a lot of definition. A simple yet effective composition. Perhaps, this would have done better without the appearance of a bit too much sharpening. On the right side of the slope, there are also two stray grains that could be easily wiped out for more effectiveness. Nice one.</td>', 'I was one of your three 10s here. I thought this image had a lot of definition. A simple yet effective composition. Perhaps, this would have done better without the appearance of a bit too much sharpening. On the right side of the slope, there are also two stray grains that could be easily wiped out for more effectiveness. Nice one.', '2005-06-01 14:51:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1426412, 180477, 37320, '<td valign="top">I didnt even notice the ring first time around.  Im happy to see that the Lumix DMC F720 is capable of making such shots, looking forward to seeing more of your work.</td>', 'I didnt even notice the ring first time around.  Im happy to see that the Lumix DMC F720 is capable of making such shots, looking forward to seeing more of your work.', '2005-06-01 14:54:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1426413, 181718, 34247, '<td valign="top">I thought this was the single strongest image that did not feature faces in the challenge. Gritty, "real" and complete with enviable sharpness and focus. It''s black and white, and metallic all at the same time.</td>', 'I thought this was the single strongest image that did not feature faces in the challenge. Gritty, "real" and complete with enviable sharpness and focus. It''s black and white, and metallic all at the same time.', '2005-06-01 14:54:43.000000', NULL, 0),
