(1427281, 181812, 19708, '<td valign="top">This type of shot would be so perfect as a book cover, with the text in the upper section.<br/>Pretty cool macro sher - not a DPC mass appeal as you already know due to your style,<br/>but I''m glad to see you have stayed with your own path, rather than losing the feel and shooting only for the voters.<br/> <br/>btw -get all the sand out of your drawers after taking it? LOL</td>', 'This type of shot would be so perfect as a book cover, with the text in the upper section.Pretty cool macro sher - not a DPC mass appeal as you already know due to your style,but I''m glad to see you have stayed with your own path, rather than losing the feel and shooting only for the voters. btw -get all the sand out of your drawers after taking it? LOL', '2005-06-01 19:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1427377, 181436, 37212, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments, this being my first submission, they are helpful.  This was not a very easy shot, I found a large ant mound and only having camera in hand it was a little tricky. The ants got really excited when I stuck the camera in the entrance of the mound, they climbed up on the camera strap till I wrapped it around my hand and I had to quit taking shots when my legs got numb from straddling the mount to try to keep ants from climbing up my legs.  I only used the the macro mode on the camera, cropped and resized.  I did realize that this shot was not focused very well, but it was the best of what I took, but I did not recheck the shot after resizing, I will do so next time.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments, this being my first submission, they are helpful.  This was not a very easy shot, I found a large ant mound and only having camera in hand it was a little tricky. The ants got really excited when I stuck the camera in the entrance of the mound, they climbed up on the camera strap till I wrapped it around my hand and I had to quit taking shots when my legs got numb from straddling the mount to try to keep ants from climbing up my legs.  I only used the the macro mode on the camera, cropped and resized.  I did realize that this shot was not focused very well, but it was the best of what I took, but I did not recheck the shot after resizing, I will do so next time.', '2005-06-01 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1427781, 180179, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 10. An original and effective presentation.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 10. An original and effective presentation.', '2005-06-01 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1427841, 181175, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  Congratulations!  Also your daughter is a beautiful young woman.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  Congratulations!  Also your daughter is a beautiful young woman.', '2005-06-01 23:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
