(1428466, 181428, 31214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldnestor:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by 4score:</b></div><hr/><i> Let me guess how many comments you''ll get about how cruel this is.  Give me a break, it''s a great shot and a SNAIL.  Personally, I don''t care at all if the thing lived or died in the process of making this shot.  I regularly purchase Snail Killer Pellets, so I''m not bothered in the least.  Right now, these beasts are over-running everything in the area due to all the rain this Spring.  Kill em all ! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is amazing to me that here we have at least two photographers who are less interested in reporting suffering than they are in perpetuating suffering. I wouldn''t have guessed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>//www.clyderobin.com/mixes/spec_sluggo.html</td>', 'Originally posted by oldnestor: Originally posted by 4score: Let me guess how many comments you''ll get about how cruel this is.  Give me a break, it''s a great shot and a SNAIL.  Personally, I don''t care at all if the thing lived or died in the process of making this shot.  I regularly purchase Snail Killer Pellets, so I''m not bothered in the least.  Right now, these beasts are over-running everything in the area due to all the rain this Spring.  Kill em all !   It is amazing to me that here we have at least two photographers who are less interested in reporting suffering than they are in perpetuating suffering. I wouldn''t have guessed.   //www.clyderobin.com/mixes/spec_sluggo.html', '2005-06-02 02:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1428469, 180477, 31214, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I like the salt.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-02 02:16:14.</i></td>', 'Nice picture, I like the salt.', '2005-06-02 03:04:44.000000', '2005-06-02 03:16:14.000000', 0),
