(1430016, 181384, 32754, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the votes 5 and above..I genuinely thought this was a powerful shot, especially in the rotated position, since I tried it in all directions and even tried it cropped more, but this is still my favorite angle; I agree with Minstrel, it speaks to me, too. On some level it causes an emotion in me, and that''s all that really matters: that it touched me and a few other people..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-02 18:33:21.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the votes 5 and above..I genuinely thought this was a powerful shot, especially in the rotated position, since I tried it in all directions and even tried it cropped more, but this is still my favorite angle; I agree with Minstrel, it speaks to me, too. On some level it causes an emotion in me, and that''s all that really matters: that it touched me and a few other people..', '2005-06-02 19:32:21.000000', '2005-06-02 19:33:21.000000', 0),
