(1443391, 179708, 37544, '<td valign="top">Syrup was the only thing I could find that would stick the sugar to his face and not dissolve it!  It was a total mess! He wasn''t mad at all, he was actually laughing the whole time and I told him to look serious and that is the look I got!  If you notice there is an ant between his eyes that I didn''t see either till later!  I should have waited till more ants found his sweet face and I probably would have done a lot better!</td>', 'Syrup was the only thing I could find that would stick the sugar to his face and not dissolve it!  It was a total mess! He wasn''t mad at all, he was actually laughing the whole time and I told him to look serious and that is the look I got!  If you notice there is an ant between his eyes that I didn''t see either till later!  I should have waited till more ants found his sweet face and I probably would have done a lot better!', '2005-06-09 09:57:36.000000', NULL, 0),
