(1624981, 181494, 35602, '<td valign="top">Wow, you got no comments on this one.  I don''t think I''ve seen any challenge entries yet with 0 comments.  Anyway, I love the interesting colors of this one.  If you had cropped out the foreground, I would almost think it was a topographical image of a mountain.  I voted it a 7 during the challenge, probably because I thought it didn''t depict granular all that much.  Still, the photo is definitely very cool.</td>', 'Wow, you got no comments on this one.  I don''t think I''ve seen any challenge entries yet with 0 comments.  Anyway, I love the interesting colors of this one.  If you had cropped out the foreground, I would almost think it was a topographical image of a mountain.  I voted it a 7 during the challenge, probably because I thought it didn''t depict granular all that much.  Still, the photo is definitely very cool.', '2005-08-19 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
