(3751027, 181743, 20530, '<td valign="top">This didn''t scream "granular" to me but I gave it an 8, because I love the color and detail. I actually looked at it for a long time just following the little trails. It reminds me of the layout for a subdivision.<br/> <br/>I was ambivalent about the circle, but ended up liking it because it gives the feeling of intimacy; as though I am viewing the image through some sort of scope. If I was drunk when I voted, then I probably gave it a 10 and then reduced it to an 8 the next day:)<br/> <br/>Nice image.</td>', 'This didn''t scream "granular" to me but I gave it an 8, because I love the color and detail. I actually looked at it for a long time just following the little trails. It reminds me of the layout for a subdivision. I was ambivalent about the circle, but ended up liking it because it gives the feeling of intimacy; as though I am viewing the image through some sort of scope. If I was drunk when I voted, then I probably gave it a 10 and then reduced it to an 8 the next day:) Nice image.', '2007-06-07 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
